title: "Kochen-Specker Extremal Lab: Certified Exact Minima of Kochen-Specker Sets Inside Coordinate Pools"
message: "If you use this software, Lean 4 proofs, or preprint, please cite this repository. Note that this is an unreviewed research preprint produced with AI assistance under human direction; no general open-problem record is claimed."
