abstract: >-
  Certified exact minimum sizes of Kochen-Specker sets inside nine finite coordinate ray pools
  (31 and 33 rays in dimension 3, 18 in dimension 4, 29 in dimension 5), including zero-Mathlib
  Lean 4.35.0 proofs for B(3,2) = 31 and B(4,1) = 18 verified by six independent Lean kernels
  via lake comparator --paranoid, alongside independent SAT/DRUP certificates. Research preprint;
  not externally peer reviewed; AI-assisted under human direction.
